F14 Tomcat  Armament: 1 20 mm M61A-1 cannon (600 rounds?), 8 AIM-9 Sidewinders of various configurations or 6 Phoenix missiles (use AAMRAAMs instead) and 2 AIM-9s. Two underwing fuel tanks (seldom used due to large internal fuel capacity) and jammer pod available. Max external weapon load for ground attack 6577 Kg (14,500 lb). 